      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفْرَعٌ</span></b>  Anything <i>tall.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفْرَعُ الكَتِفِ</span>
A man <i>broad in the shoulder-blade:</i> (S, O, TA:)
or <i>high therein.</i> (TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَتِفٌ مُفْرَعَةٌ</span> <i>A
shoulder-blade high, projecting, and broad.</i> (TA.)

